			<div class="content" id="post-content-2667755">
									

<p>Hey there, thanks for reading! This is my first article for the site, hopefully the first of many (or, like, at least five). I realised last month that it was almost a year since I joined, so I decided to get off my ass and put together my endless scribbled drafts and notes into one proper article.</p>
<p>If you've finished this and are confused about the ending (or any of the rest of it), that's ok. If people seem to want it, I'll put out an explanation in a few weeks, but if you enjoyed it that's all that counts. Of course, if you didn't enjoy it, let me know. There's a solid chance I'll build upon this some other day with a linked tale or skip, but obviously the article should stand on its own two feet.</p>
<p>My friend Omino made <a href="http://imgur.com/ZFVQ2gn.png">this</a> excellent MTF seal for Upsilon-4, but over the course of changes and edits I couldn't figure out a place to stick it in the article itself. Ah well. It'll probably come in handy later.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I'd&nbsp;like&nbsp;to&nbsp;thank...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">...&nbsp;the&nbsp;Academy&nbsp;for&nbsp;giving&nbsp;me&nbsp;this&nbsp;opportunity</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Big thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2221240); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1476053245" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2221240); return false;">Aiden Eldritch</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1476053245" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;">minmin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theshrike" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1834351); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1834351&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1476053245" alt="TheShrike" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1834351)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theshrike" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1834351); return false;">TheShrike</a></span> for looking at this in its crappy unfinished state, particularly Shrikey for talking to me for actual damn hours before I got around to looking at their draft.</p>
<p>Thanks to everyone who read it and gave me feedback in main chats - I'm sorry, I'm terrible with names and there were a number of you, but you were indeed helpful even if you just gave a thumbs up.</p>
<p>A wholly unironic thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1379080&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1476053245" alt="Randomini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1379080)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;">Randomini</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jekeled" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1349098); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1349098&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1476053245" alt="Jekeled" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1349098)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jekeled" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1349098); return false;">Jekeled</a></span> who looked at this, found it lacking, and talked at length about how I could make it better by, for instance, turning it into a tale or series of tales. The fact that I entirely ignored your advice does not mean it wasn't really good. I accept and anticipate your respective downvotes.</p>
<p>Final thanks to my Dad, who told me he had no idea what I was talking about when I explained this to him back in November 2015, but let me know that he had vitiligo and most likely so did I. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I knew then that destiny had fated me to write this skip</span> Coincidences are neat.</p>
