<p>Turns out I dialed down my reading comprehension yesterday. &quot;No non-anomalous transmission method of SCP-2559 is known.&quot; I read this as &quot;no anomalous transmission method&quot;&#8230; don't even ask me how. I thought you implied it wasn't known that it spread meme-style. The opposite was true - it doesn't spread like a normal virus.</p>
