<p>So yeah, you can ignore what I wrote! Sorry.</p>
<p>Edit: Although it would be difficult to work into the containment procedures, staff that are particularly arrogant and skeptic would probably avoid infection quite easily. &quot;Bah, I'm not going to die from some random disease&#8230; I'm a god! Most of what goes on in here is just for show anyway, yall are probably just playing a prank with those skin rashes&#8230;&quot;</p>
