<p>I think that's exactly what it's doing.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;me&nbsp;the&nbsp;hidden&nbsp;content</a></div>
